{"last_link_id": 22, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#446688", "widgets_values": ["Krea2 Turbo 双采样器文生图工作流\n基于 ComfyUI 0.25.0+ 原生 Krea2 支持\n\n【工作流架构】\n  第一采样器：832×1216 基础构图 (28步, denoise=1.0)\n  潜空间放大：LatentUpscaleBy 1.5x (nearest-exact)\n  第二采样器：1248×1824 高分辨率精修 (20步, denoise=0.45)\n  最终输出：VAEDecode → ImageScaleToTotalPixels → SaveImage\n\n【模型文件】\n  DiT模型: krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors (diffusion_models/)\n  文本编码器: qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors (text_encoders/)\n  VAE: qwen_image_vae.safetensors (vae/)\n  风格LoRA: krea2_sunsetblur.safetensors (loras/) [可选]\n\n【CLIPLoader 类型必须设为 'krea'】\n  Krea2 需要 Qwen3-VL 全部12层特征拼接 (12×2560=30720维)\n  若 type 下拉菜单无 'krea' 选项，请更新 ComfyUI 至 0.25.0+\n\n【参数调优建议】\n  • 第一采样器步数：20-28步 (更多步数=更稳定构图)\n  • 第二采样器步数：15-25步 (精修步数)\n  • 放大倍数：1.25x-2.0x (1.5x为平衡点)\n  • 第二采样器 denoise：0.3-0.55 (越低越保留原图)\n  • LoRA 强度：0.5-1.0 (sunsetblur 风格)\n\n【下载地址】\n  HuggingFace: https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Krea-2"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "title": "★ Krea2 双采样器使用说明", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#335577", "size": [480, 480], "pos": [20, 20], "id": 1, "properties": {}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "slot_index": 0, "links": [1], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["krea2_turbo_fp8_scaled.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "UNET名称", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "UNET名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "权重类型", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "权重类型"}], "flags": {}, "type": "UNETLoader", "title": "DiT 模型加载器 (Krea2 Turbo)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [340, 100], "pos": [560, 20], "id": 2, "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "UNETLoader"}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "slot_index": 0, "links": [2], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["qwen3vl_4b_fp8_scaled.safetensors", "k